    "body": "@LJWatson might want to take a look at this. We have interop on the current behavior, is this issue pointing out a known problem?\r\n\r\nSeems like the proposed text would reset focus to whatever the document's first focusable thing would be, rather than the next focusable element relative to where the target anchor was. It could also direct a screen reader *past* the intended anchor point, causing users to miss information in between.",
