    "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:53:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-31T12:53:03Z",
    "body": "The proposed text in OP is\n\n> 1. Run the focusing steps for the Document's viewport.\n> 1. Unset the sequential focus navigation starting point.\n\nRunning the focusing steps for a viewport will focus the viewport, not the first focusable element.\n\nUnsetting the sequential focus navigation starting point means that when you press tab, focus moves to the first element in the tab order.\n\nI think this seems like an improvement for keyboard navigation UX.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
